# Config Loading And Schema

Canonical loading and formatting own defaults. Runtime consumers must not reapply them.

## Placement

- `config.live` — live and shared with backtest/optimizer
- `config.backtest` — simulation-only
- `config.optimize` — optimizer-only

Migrations and renames need tests and, when user-facing, a `CHANGELOG.md` `Unreleased` note.

## Validation

Loader/default/roundtrip tests, parity across every canonical default-producing surface, and affected `configs/examples/` updates. See `docs/ai/validation.md`.
